ng retconned internet stuff but it  also doesn't fit internet stuff so let's  just say it and not kid ourselves  nen did not exist when togashi began  writing the series and because tagashi  also doesn't give the most attention to  world building it's a tricky concept to  understand because it's meant to be this  incredibly well-kept secret  something that the hunter association  has an entire exam based around deciding  who  and who is not worthy of learning the  secret but at the same time the hunter  association has  no control whatsoever over this nen  secret because everyone knows about nen  unless they're not supposed to once  again we refer to the rules of hunter  hunter it's a rule until it isn't and  then it isn't  until it is again like take gantry for  example he is not a hunter and yet he  possesses advanced in-depth knowledge  about nen specifically the framework  taught by the shinken ryu school of kung  fu  the same can be said for the phantom  troop who must have become nen users in  isolation and yet  they practice men with the exact same  terminology as someone who was formally  taught but even common groups understand  men we have random residents of meteor  city that can use it  it was very common amongst the mafia  families of the ten dons many of the  karkin empire  bodyguards and end users as well as  their extended mafia families and there  was even that one random soldier in  escorto who was somehow an experienced  or a wielder and not to mention all of  the heaven's arena combatants on the  200th floor and beyond who publicly  showcase their inabilities on a regular  basis and sure they might be invisible  to the world watching them but the  effects of their abilities are not has  no one ever become curious as to exactly  how these superhuman fighters pull off  what would seem to be clear sorcery  stuff like castro making a full-on nen  body double that wasn't even invisible  because that ability was conjured so  from the perspective of eve