ut the real eyes on  the black market and neon won them again  however this wouldn't actually be  possible because after crollow stole  neon's netability her father  lightnistrad lost his source of income  which was selling her fortune  tellingness so he would not have been  able to purchase the eyes for his  daughter of course karapaka took over  the nastrad family and i suppose you  could argue that he used their funds to  buy the eyes regardless  if they somehow had the funds that is  but then in that case the statement  about gaining them through naon becomes  false so it's just  easier to slice this whole argument cake  up with a nice occam's razor and say  that togashi clearly forgot about the  eyes  plain and simple as such we will now  turn to icalgo and the burning issue of  names now many people forget this  including myself sometimes but our lion  and  leo actually had an original name which  was hagya and he changed his name to leo  to better reflect the individual that he  was becoming having more pride in his uh  his  lioness but this actually formed a  pretty major dramatic crux for the  ocargo character because he accidentally  referred to leo as hagia during the  palace invasion  whilst controlling flutter's body which  of course caused brother to become  highly highly suspicious of this flutter  because he  of all people should have known to call  him leol but the thing we kind of miss  at this point  is that also of all people who should  have known to call him leol would have  been icalgo because hicalgo was actually  a captain in a group that was literally  called the lael squad and he was even  working with the squad to hunt down  killua and this was  after leial had changed his name so from  any kind of reasonable standpoint  ikalgo should have known that hagia was  now called leo particularly as  cargo was a member of once again the  lael squad  to get around this we would need to  perform some sort of olympic level  mental gymnastics to force what actually  happened in the story what we would need  to do is insist that icalgo despite  being a direct subordinate of flutter  had no contact with the lael squad but i  mean if like  that premise already doesn't work  because flutter was in close contact  with the cargo via telepathy during this  whole kilowatt event but the weirdest  thing is that for whatever reason  neither flutter nor leol  nor anyone informed ikalgo of the name  change which seems really odd  considering how much lael hated being  referred to by his previous name it just  makes no sense ikalgo  should have known the only way that i'd  accept his ignorance  is if he was a member of a different  squad that happened to stumble upon  killua at the same  time as leo's group but he wasn't he was  a member of once again  the layol squad and so this whole name  business whilst being an incredibly  tense and wonderful moment during the  palace invasion  logically it well it never should have  been a thing unless they'd all gotten  together and decided to just  troll the calgo for fun which i wouldn't  put beyond someone like cleol he's a  sneaky funny lion dude but in the end it  just results in him getting trolled when  the name hoggier eventually comes up  again and he gets all like you know  lion angry but this is just a taste of  the many hunt hunter inconsistencies  this whole series is like a beautiful  mess of a puzzle that doesn't quite fit  together properly but it looks amazing  regardless and to explore this puzzle  some more here's another fun video for  you there's always more to learn explore  and experience about this wonderful  series so i look forward to seeing you  there

